  "description": "A medium-to-large hybrid database infrastructure implemented in C# for the .NET platform: dual embedded/network modes, integrating relational, time-series, message queue, and NoSQL (KV) engines; NativeAOT-ready, with built-in runtime localization. 以 C# 实现、运行于 .NET 平台的中大型混合数据库基础设施：嵌入/服务双模，融合关系型、时序、消息队列、NoSQL(KV) 能力；原生 AOT 就绪，内置运行时多语言。",
